This product implements the architecture of Kyutai's Mimi neural audio codec.
The model weights downloaded from https://huggingface.co/kyutai/mimi are not
part of this distribution and are licensed separately under CC-BY-4.0.

Mimi is described in "Moshi: a speech-text foundation model for real-time
dialogue" by Alexandre Défossez et al., arXiv:2410.00037.
